    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17646" root="زرد" body-key="z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَرَدَانٌ</span></b>  The <i>vulva</i> of a woman: (K, TA:) accord.
to some, (TA,) so called because it swallows
(<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَزْدَرِدٌ</span>), or because it compresses (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَزْرُدُ</span> [in the CK
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَزْدَرِدُ</span> again]), (K, TA,) i. e. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَخْنُقُ</span>, (TA,) the
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُيُور</span>, by its straitness. (K, TA.)

